      <m>X=1</m> if the outcome is a success and <m>X=0</m> if failure. Then
      <m>X</m> is called a <fillin characters="20"/> random variable and the experiment is a <fillin characters="20"/> experiment.
    </p>

    <p>
      Denote by <m>p</m> the probability of success, then the pmf of <m>X</m> is
    </p>
