    <exercise workspace = "1.5in">
    <statement>
        <p>
             Roll a die <m>10</m> times and let <m>X</m> be the number of times I
            get a <m>5</m>. How is <m>X</m> distributed? Find <m>P(X=3)</m>.
        </p>
